explore-design direction library: the taste, minimalist-editorial and
industrial-brutalist directions are adapted from taste-skill by Leon Lin.

Upstream-Repo: https://github.com/Leonxlnx/taste-skill
Upstream-Paths: skills/taste-skill/SKILL.md (taste, commits 3c7017d to 9b7d575);
  minimalist-skill/SKILL.md (added bd7e147); brutalist-skill/SKILL.md (added c826a41)

Local changes: split into explore-design direction references; scope and
approval moved to explore-design's medium-and-providers reference; universal
quality rules moved out to implement's ui-build floor (page-craft.md);
image-generation priority replaced by the owner's imagery choice; invented
client logos replaced by tagged placeholders; the block-library contract
removed and the motion code skeletons split into an on-demand
motion-skeletons.md.


