visual system (Part B) of landing-page-design by Elaya.

Upstream-Repo: https://github.com/elayadesign/ai-design-skills
Upstream-Path: skills/landing-page-design
Upstream-Commit: ded7efc9d5c02761c41a03caf3b78f9259ab8828

Local changes: look rules only; craft rules (states, launch checklist,
nested radius, motion safety, content realism) live in implement's
page-craft floor; the advice to invent believable names and figures was
dropped; headline breaks come from max width and text wrapping instead of
manual breaks; the gradient heading is listed as an override of web.md.

